TrifoldDesk adapts the LensOffset profile from GlassDesk 1.4.0
(Copyright 2026 everlosttime and GlassDesk contributors), originally adapted
from Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass (Copyright 2025 Kyant).
Original source commit: 65ab177e90e5c1d8c62e70cf7755841982da65f6.

The lens profile is Apache-2.0. The bundled LICENSE contains the license text.
TrifoldDesk applies the profile with its own rounded-rectangle sampling and blur.

The Launchpad also adapts GlassDesk 1.4.0 AndroidLiquidGlassRenderer,
GlassSignedDistance, LiquidGlassDispersionParameters, SquircleGlassGeometry,
and ContinuousGlassGeometry. These historical source files are Apache-2.0.
TrifoldDesk changes their namespaces and supplies its own desktop capture,
tint, and resolution budget.
